tps://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["distributed-systems","dubbo","framework","grpc","http","java","microservices","restful","rpc","service-mesh","web"],"visibility":"public","forks":26542,"open_issues":928,"watchers":41703,"default_branch":"3.3","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"# Weekly Report of Dubbo\n\nThis is a weekly report of Dubbo. It summarizes what have changed in the project during the passed week, including pr merged, new contributors, and more things in the future. \nIt is all done by @dubbo-bot which is a collaborate robot.\n\n\n## Repo Overview\n\n### Basic data\n\nBaisc data shows how the watch, star, fork and contributors count changed in the passed week.\n\n| Watch | Star | Fork | Contributors |\n|:-----:|:----:|:----:|:------------:|\n| 3200 | 25890 (↑192) | 14551 (↑82) | 191 (↑1) |\n\n### Issues & PRs\n\nIssues & PRs show the new/closed issues/pull requests count in the passed week.\n\n| New Issues | Closed Issues | New PR | Merged PR |\n|:----------:|:-------------:|:------:|:---------:|\n| 17 | 9 | 10 | 5 |\n\n## PR Overview\n\nThanks to contributions from community, Dubbo team merged **5** pull requests in the repository last week. They are:\n\n* ignore flatten related files. ([#3885](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3885))\n* make protocols a mutable list (a concrete ArrayList) ([#3869](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3869))\n* Fix javadoc for Adaptive.value() ([#3867](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3867))\n* [DUBBO-3746] Bugfix: infinite loop in AbstractRegistry when IOException. fix #3746 ([#3748](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3748))\n* [Dubbo-3707] Merge dubbo-serialization-gson into incubator-dubbo ([#3714](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3714))\n\n\n## Code Review Statistics\n\nDubbo encourages everyone to participant in code review, in order to improve software quality. Every week @dubbo-bot would automatically help to count pull request reviews of single github user as the following. So, try to help review code in this project.\n\n| Contributor ID | Pull Request Reviews |\n|:--------------:|:--------------------:|\n| @ralf0131 | 8 |\n| @satansk | 6 |\n| @chenlushun | 4 |\n| @Moriadry | 3 |\n| @carryxyh | 2 |\n| @Jeff-Lv | 1 |\n| @tswstarplanet | 1 |\n\n\n## Contributors Overview\n\nIt is Dubbo team's great honor to have new contributors from community. We really appreciate your contributions. Feel free to tell us if you have any opinion and please share this open source project with more people if you could. If you hope to be a contributor as well, please start from https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md .\nHere is the list of new contributors:\n\n@Moriadry\n\n\nThanks to you all.\n\n\n\n*Note: This robot is supported by [Collabobot](https://github.com/AlibabaDR/Collabobot).*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/3893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/3893/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2371372228,"node_id":"MDE1Ok1pbGVzdG9uZWRFdmVudDIzNzEzNzIyMjg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/events/2371372228","actor":{"login":"cvictory","id":4089452,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwODk0NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4089452?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvictory","html_url":"https://github.com/cvictory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvictory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvictory/follo